'''Grand Spectrala Islet''' (Japanese: '''マホラ小島''' ''Mahora Islet'') is a Pokémon sanctuary and the fourth island {{Ash}}, {{an|Iris}}, and {{an|Cilan}} visited during their travels through the [[Decolore Islands]]. It is only accessible from [[Grand Spectrala Island]] when the tide is low, since the only bridge connecting the islands is destroyed.

Being mostly covered with a forest, the only building on the island is an abandoned [[Pokémon Center]] which shut ten years prior due to a decline in visiting [[Pokémon Trainer]]s. [[Giant Pokémon]] are said to inhabit here, however, in ''[[BW127|The Island of Illusions!]]'' all of them were proven to be {{a|illusion}}s created by a {{p|Zoroark}} in order to protect the other [[wild Pokémon]] on the island from {{pkmn|hunter}}s.

The formerly abandoned Pokémon Center was recommissioned by its previous [[Nurse Joy]], who was originally sent there to investigate rumors of an illegally operated Pokémon Center. With the help of Ash and {{ashfr}}, both Nurse Joy and Zoroark were able to clean up and reopen the center to heal the island's [[wild Pokémon]].
